| **HoA Leadership, Planning ****&**** Strategy** | **4 · On Track** | Strong leadership. Device bid in progress (approved). DLs named and active. Clear awareness of all gaps. |
| **Infrastructure ****&**** Devices** | **3 · Developing** | Significant device barrier (score 1). iPad bid approved — timeline unclear. LapSafe in EYE. Theory lessons disrupted. |
| **Digital Skills Assessment ****&**** Tracking** | **5 · Confident** | VSPs, assessments, portfolio evidence, placement feedback all in use. Exceptionally well-embedded. |
| **Digital Curriculum Integration** | **5 · Confident** | Social media, online consultations, booking systems, photography, portfolios — all embedded in curriculum. |
| **Learner Readiness ****&**** Digital Confidence** | **5 · Confident** | No barriers noted. Strong learner engagement and outcomes. |
