**Notes on methodology and limitations**

This assessment is derived exclusively from HoA self-report audit responses submitted April–May 2026. It should be treated as a starting point for coaching conversations, not as a validated judgement. Scores represent the best interpretation of available evidence — where evidence is ambiguous or absent, this is noted rather than estimated.

The 8-dimension framework is new and supersedes the 6-dimension framework used in previous assessments. Scores are not directly comparable with earlier ratings.

Two areas require area code confirmation before being formally mapped to the 35-area structure: FE Counselling (Tasha Thorne) and Project Management (Mark Barnett).

